Movies API – Local Development

1. Start the development server

bash
cd \services\movies
pnpm dev


####2. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3005/api/health


####3. Search Movie by IMDb ID
GET http://localhost:3005/api/movies/tt0780504


####4. Search Movie by Title
GET http://localhost:3005/api/movies/title?title=Drive


####5. Search Movie by Title and Year
GET http://localhost:3005/api/movies/title?title=Drive&year=2011

####6. Non-Strict Search by Title and Type
GET http://localhost:3005/api/movies/search?q=Drive&type=movie